<SECTION image-layout="left">
  <IMG class="accent-image" query="modern clean technology innovation lab with renewable energy equipment" />
  <DIV class="body">
    <H1 style="text-align: left">Defining Trends Shaping Climate Tech</H1>
    <SMART-LAYOUT variant="solidBoxes" cellSize="15" horizontalAlign="left">
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>AI-Powered Energy Optimization</H4>
        <P>Google's DeepMind reduces data center cooling costs by 40%. Smart grid AI manages 30% of renewable energy distribution in California, predicting demand within 2% accuracy.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>Corporate Net-Zero Acceleration</H4>
        <P>Microsoft commits $1B to carbon removal by 2030. Over 1,500 companies join Science Based Targets initiative, creating $23B annual market for climate solutions.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>Green Hydrogen Scale-Up</H4>
        <P>Production costs drop 85% since 2015 to $3/kg. Saudi Arabia's NEOM project targets 1.2M tons annually by 2026, supplying Europe and Asia markets.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>Direct Air Capture Momentum</H4>
        <P>Climeworks' Iceland facility captures 4,000 tons CO2 annually. Costs projected to reach $100/ton by 2030, making large-scale deployment economically viable.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
    </SMART-LAYOUT>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>